WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 8.9 · Marketing & Communications
Campaigns and calls to action

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
A campaign asks one audience for one action, within a set time.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Set a measurable goal and an end date.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Make the call to action one easy step.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Check claims, safeguards and approvals before launch.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Tide Line Youth Collective (Community group · idea stage, Indonesia)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“30 signed parent consent forms before the first planting day: “Two trained adults always there. No deep water.””

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write a campaign brief with risks and approvals.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
